retropie-rom-manager (2.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * The UI scales up on 1440p and 4K displays, so it looks the same as on
    1080p. Set ROM_MANAGER_SCALE (e.g. 1.5) to choose the size yourself.
  * New command-line options: --fullscreen, --theme light|dark, --version
    and --help. Right-click the launcher for Open in Fullscreen.
  * The window now fits on small screens such as 1366x768 instead of running
    off the bottom.

 -- FA Saikat <fahimabrar.saikat@gmail.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 19:16:55 +0600

retropie-rom-manager (2.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * arm64 .deb for Raspberry Pi 4/5 (64-bit Raspberry Pi OS) and Armbian.
  * Fix a blank window on GPUs whose OpenGL ES driver lacks vertex storage
    buffers, such as the Mali-G31 on Panfrost.
  * Light theme is now the default.
  * Run with RUST_LOG=info to see which GPU and renderer the app picked.

 -- FA Saikat <fahimabrar.saikat@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:40:03 +0600

retropie-rom-manager (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Support all 37 RetroPie systems, with an "Add emulator" picker and
    removal of systems you no longer use.
  * Identify ROMs by their contents and catch games installed to the
    wrong system, with one-click move (adding the right system if needed).
  * Play games straight from the app with RetroPie's default emulator.
  * Fetch box art and metadata with Skyscraper, and install Skyscraper
    from inside the app when it's missing.
  * New interface built on GPUI Kit: box-art grid and list views, search,
    game details panel, drag and drop, light and dark themes.

 -- FA Saikat <fahimabrar.saikat@gmail.com>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:52:49 +0600

